# misspelled top-level and query keys
GET logs/_search
{"qeury": {}, "query": {"bool": {"shuld": []}}}
warns: Unknown property `qeury`
warns: Unknown property `shuld`
---
# unknown endpoint
GET logs/_serch
warns: No endpoint matches
---
# unknown query parameter
GET logs/_search?pretty&sise=3
warns: Unknown parameter `sise`
---
# broken JSON
GET logs/_search
{"size": }
warns: expected value
---
# unknown bulk action key
POST _bulk
{"indx": {}}
{"a": 1}
warns: Unknown property `indx`
---
# unknown key inside a mapping property
PUT a
{"mappings": {"properties": {"t": {"typ": "text"}}}}
warns: Unknown property `typ`
